{"last_link_id": 59, "nodes": [{"outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [], "label": "text", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#257d7e", "widgets_values": ["【角色设定 / Role】\nGender/Age: Female (40s)\nVoice Type: Mezzo-Soprano\nTexture: Smooth, velvety，略带沙哑的性感，如同清晨的薄雾与暖阳交织\nAccent: 吐字清晰，语调中带有一丝异域的慵懒与魅惑，仿佛古老咒语般富有节奏感\n\n【演绎风格 / Style & Emotion】\nEmotion: 神秘、诱惑、自信、平静中蕴含着不容置疑的力量\nTechnique:\n1. Breathy/Vocal Strength: 气声与实声交替，气声用于营造私密与诱惑感，实声则在关键句末展现沉稳的控制力。\n2. Pacing (节奏): 语速缓慢，语句间有意味深长的停顿，如同蛇行般蜿蜒流转，不急不躁。\n3. Intonation (语调): 语调起伏平缓，但每个词语都经过精心雕琢，尾音略微上扬或下沉，带有勾引与试探的意味。\n4. Micro-expressions: 声音中带着一丝不易察觉的微笑，以及对周遭一切尽在掌握的笃定。在特定词汇上，会隐约出现蛇类嘶鸣般的“s”音。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "type": "CR Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#174e4f", "size": [395.3337707519531, 412.7071228027344], "pos": [-2335.523193359375, 1824.3980712890625], "id": 36, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "音频", "links": [9], "label": "音频", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "音频"}], "size": [495.2929992675781, 430], "pos": [-2533.75537109375, -1813.0087890625], "widgets_values": ["", "", "自动", false, 8000, 54489798768, "随机", 1, false, 0.8, 50, 0.8, 1.1, false], "inputs": [{"name": "模型", "link": 8, "label": "模型", "type": "QWEN3_TTS_MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}, {"widget": {"name": "文本"}, "name": "文本", "link": 24, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}, {"widget": {"name": "提示词"}, "name": "提示词", "link": 58, "label": "提示词", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}, {"widget": {"name": "语言"}, "name": "语言", "label": "语言", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "语言"}, {"widget": {"name": "自动卸载模型